  "item_short_desc": "<p>Show your patriotic pride with Rothco&rsquo;s 1776 T-Shirt. This striking black tee prominently features \"1776\" across the chest, surrounded by the 13 stars of the iconic Betsy Ross flag. The right sleeve includes the historic Betsy Ross flag print, adding a bold and timeless touch. Made from a breathable and durable cotton blend, this shirt ensures all-day comfort while maintaining its rugged wearability. The tagless design, with sizing information printed inside, enhances comfort by eliminating irritation.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
